  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueChampionRoom_Text_CynthiaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Have you been keeping well?\r",
        "Thank you for Mt. Coronet.\n",
        "And for the Distortion World.\f",
        "I’m truly grateful.\r",
        "Together, you and your Pokémon\n",
        "overcame all the challenges you\f",
        "faced, however difficult.\r",
        "It means that you’ve triumphed\n",
        "over any personal weaknesses, too.\r",
        "The power you learned...\n",
        "I can feel it emanating from you.\r",
        "But that’s enough talk.\n",
        "Let’s get on with why you’re here.\r",
        "As the Pokémon League Champion,\n",
        "I accept your challenge!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cynthia: Comment vas-tu\n",
        "depuis l’autre fois?\r",
        "Merci pour le Mont Couronné.\n",
        "Et pour le Monde Distorsion.\r",
        "Toi et tes Pokémon avez surmonté\n",
        "toutes les épreuves ensemble.\r",
        "Tu as beaucoup mûri, ça \n",
        "se voit tout de suite.\r",
        "Cette force que tu as accumulée...\n",
        "Je peux la sentir émaner de toi.\r",
        "Mais assez parlé, passons \n",
        "aux choses sérieuses.\r",
        "Moi, Maître de la Ligue Pokémon, \n",
        "j’accepte ton défi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueChampionRoom_Text_CynthiaDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: That was excellent.\n",
        "Truly, an outstanding battle.\r",
        "You gave the support your Pokémon\n",
        "needed to maximize their power.\r",
        "And you guided them with certainty\n",
        "to secure victory.\r",
        "You have both passion and\n",
        "calculating coolness.\r",
        "Together, you and your Pokémon \n",
        "can overcome any challenge\f",
        "that may come your way.\r",
        "Those are the impressions I got\n",
        "from our battle.\r",
        "I’m glad I got to take part in the\n",
        "crowning of Sinnoh’s new Champion!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cynthia: C’était incroyable. \n",
        "Quel combat magnifique!\r",
        "Tu as réussi à donner à tes \n",
        "Pokémon la force de se dépasser.\r",
        "Tu les as menés de main \n",
        "de maître vers la victoire.\r",
        "Tu as tout: passion, intelligence...\n",
        "Toi et tes Pokémon, vous êtes capables\f",
        "de relever tous les défis.\r",
        "Voilà ce que je ressens \n",
        "après notre combat.\r",
        "Je suis heureuse d’avoir joué \n",
        "un rôle dans le couronnement \f",
        "du nouveau Maître de Sinnoh!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueChampionRoom_Text_ComeWithMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Come with me.\n",
        "We’ll take the lift.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Prends l’ascenseur, je te rejoins.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueChampionRoom_Text_CynthiaGameCompletedIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: One look at you tells\n",
        "me many things about you.\r",
        "Together, you and your Pokémon\n",
        "overcame all the challenges you\f",
        "faced, however difficult.\r",
        "It means that you’ve triumphed over\n",
        "any personal weaknesses, too.\r",
        "The power you learned...\n",
        "I can feel it from you.\r",
        "That’s enough talking.\n",
        "Let’s get on with why you’re here.\r",
        "I, Cynthia, accept your challenge as\n",
        "the Pokémon League Champion!\r",
        "There won’t be any letup from me!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cynthia: Rien qu’en te regardant, je \n",
        "peux en dire beaucoup sur toi.\r",
        "Toi et tes Pokémon avez surmonté\n",
        "toutes les épreuves ensemble.\r",
        "Tu as beaucoup mûri, ça \n",
        "se voit tout de suite.\r",
        "Cette force que tu as accumulée...\n",
        "Je peux la sentir émaner de toi.\r",
        "Mais assez parlé, passons \n",
        "aux choses sérieuses.\r",
        "Moi, Maître de la Ligue \n",
        "Pokémon, j’accepte ton défi!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
